flowchart TD
    A[Approved engineering change records] --> B{Required fields complete?}
    B -- No --> C[Request clarification]
    C --> A
    B -- Yes --> D[Risk triage]
    D --> E[AI creates draft]
    E --> F[Map claims to source IDs]
    F --> G[Technical writer review]
    G --> H{Facts and coverage verified?}
    H -- No --> I[Correct or clarify]
    I --> G
    H -- Yes --> J{Specialist review required?}
    J -- Yes --> K[Product / security / legal approval]
    K --> L{Approved?}
    L -- No --> I
    L -- Yes --> M[Human publication]
    J -- No --> M
    M --> N[Measure quality and effort]
